The only things special in Gehennom are fire traps (get fire resistance), 
the special Gehennom monsters (not much preparation necessary, maybe get 
a /oFire for green Ps) and inability to pray (stock up on emergency items).
None of the preparations necessary for that are exclusively useful in
Gehennom; most players are prepared for it anyway at the point they reach
the valley.

