> Let me ask this question of you
>   Why do YOU want to come back more than once from Gehennom?

Why shouldn't I? I go into Gehennom when I get to it, usually. Explore
some, aquire some stuff, maybe kill a demon lord. Return to the stash from
time to time for inventory management and such. No real difference to my
playing style before Gehennom. Eventually, when I have the Candelabrum,
completed my AK, relearned all my spells and found the VS, I'll enter
Gehennom one last time without the intention to return, but there is
absolutely no reason to restrict myself before that.

> I consider repeatedly entering / exiting Gehennom to consolidate loot
> to be a waste of time. By that point of the game you should have more
